Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:30:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 366/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the Voice ring
 (0365)

The still ring under reduced motion draws once per mode, theme or pixel-ratio change instead of on every mic frame, with cached colours and no brightness pulse. Theme changes (dark class, prefers-color-scheme) redraw it. The painted ring is scaled to stay inside the circle's margin and the canvas sits behind the circle and text. The sheet's speaking label, disc and ring share one amber token with a darker light-mode value for contrast. The canvas buffer follows devicePixelRatio changes. Tests cover each.
